next to this file. This directory is the anipy_api package of the anipy-api 3.8.21
release, unmodified. It is vendored here because pip can't install the release on
Android: some of its declared dependencies have no Android build, and none of them
are imported by the parts Tubcal uses. The package's source is the release itself,
at the link above.

Tubcal for Android shadows one of its imports, `Levenshtein`, with its own small
module (app/src/main/python/Levenshtein.py). That module contains no code from
anipy-api or from the Levenshtein package.
